Case 1: the nation pair joins fact before the other alias -- the pair is 4900 rows, not 87     

===================================================
count(*)    
4900     

Query plan:
nl-join (inner join)
    edge:  term[?]
    outer: hash-join (inner join)
               edge:  term[?]
               outer: iscan
                          class: sn node[?]
                          index: i_nat_name term[?]
                          cost:  ? card ?
               inner: sscan
                          class: fact node[?]
                          cost:  ? card ?
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: iscan
               class: cn node[?]
               index: i_nat_name term[?] (covers)
               filtr: term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(*) from nat sn, nat cn, fact fact where sn.id=fact.id and ((sn.n_name= ?:?  and cn.n_name= ?:? ) or (sn.n_name= ?:?  and cn.n_name= ?:? )) and ((sn.n_name= ?:? ) or (sn.n_name= ?:? )) and ((cn.n_name= ?:? ) or (cn.n_name= ?:? ))
